{"id": 1002, "date": "2026-03-24T18:00:44", "date_gmt": "2026-03-24T09:00:44", "guid": {"rendered": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/?p=1002"}, "modified": "2026-04-21T18:09:24", "modified_gmt": "2026-04-21T09:09:24", "slug": "%e3%82%a6%e3%82%a7%e3%83%ab%e3%82%ab%e3%83%a0%e3%82%a2%e3%83%8a%e3%82%a6%e3%83%b3%e3%82%b95%e9%80%b1%e9%80%a3%e7%b6%9a%e4%b8%8a%e6%98%a0%e6%b1%ba%e5%ae%9a%ef%bc%81", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/1002/", "title": {"rendered": "”ウェルカムアナウンス”5週連続上映決定！"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p>3月27日(金)より新たな劇場施策として、本編上映前にキャラクターたちによるここでしか聞けないトークが聞ける”ウェルカムアナウンス”の上映が決定いたしました！</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1035\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/5ed7cecb7c1c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"996\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/5ed7cecb7c1c.png 300w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/34ab50544c08.png 150w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/799960be39d5.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/4703b1fe083d.png 1024w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/12941550cc3c.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 996px) 100vw, 996px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>＜ウェルカムアナウンス＞</strong><br />\n実施期間：3 月 27 日（金）～4 月 30 日（木）<br />\n担当キャラクター：<br />\n<del>第 1 週（3/27～4/2）：かぐや</del><br />\n<del>第 2 週（4/3～4/9）：かぐや＆彩葉</del><br />\n<del>第 3 週（4/10～4/16）：彩葉＆ヤチヨ</del><br />\n<del>第 4 週（4/17～4/23）：かぐや＆ヤチヨ</del><br />\n第 5 週（4/24～4/30）：かぐや＆彩葉＆ヤチヨ</p>\n<p>※3月27日（金）より、『超かぐや姫！』上映館にて、本編開始前に上映いたします。</p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>3月27日(金)より新たな劇場施策として、本編上映前にキャラクターたちによるここでしか聞けないトークが聞ける”ウェルカムアナウンス”の上映が決定いたしました！ ＜ウェルカムアナウンス＞ 実施期間：3 月 27 日（金）～ [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 8, "featured_media": 0, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"_acf_changed": false, "footnotes": ""}, "categories": [1], "tags": [], "class_list": ["post-1002", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "hentry", "category-uncategorized"], "acf": [], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/1002", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts"}], "about": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/post"}], "author": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/users/8"}], "replies": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/comments?post=1002"}], "version-history": [{"count": 9, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/1002/revisions"}], "predecessor-version": [{"id": 1112, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/1002/revisions/1112"}], "wp:attachment": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=1002"}], "wp:term": [{"taxonomy": "category", "embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/categories?post=1002"}, {"taxonomy": "post_tag", "embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/tags?post=1002"}], "curies": [{"name": "wp", "href": "https://api.w.org/{rel}", "templated": true}]}}